## How this was worked out

You said you drive 800–1,200 km a month and plan to keep the car for 5 years, paying with cash. Every number comes from 50,000 simulated futures of ownership (model sim-v1, seed 42), so re-running with the same seed reproduces this report exactly.

**Data warnings:**
- 59 model assumptions (prices, tariffs, depreciation…) are placeholder values, not sourced data.
